# The Goldenrod Game Corner: a jaunty, swinging vibraphone in C major over a walking bass and an electric piano, for
# the lights and the bustle, with a turn to F in its second half. Indoors it plays the same by day and night. Original
# composition for this game (plan 20 · J5, part b).
